ndable Detective Fuzz to Traff, the Princess of Cursing, who hits like a truck and talks like a truck driver, there\u2019s plenty of characters to meet and loot to discover!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153190/extras/4048a33473d0e738f02adf033187be0d.poster.avif?t=1729672090\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153190/extras/4048a33473d0e738f02adf033187be0d.webm?t=1729672090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153190/extras/4048a33473d0e738f02adf033187be0d.mp4?t=1729672090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153190/extras/94f8d50e85a43cfe2713e5c66e8f99c0.avif?t=1729672090\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Work together with a friend in local CO-OP to save your allies and battle back the waves of wetness corrupting the world!<br><br>Experience the first few hours of INK INSIDE in this standalone instalment for FREE! And once your journey is going, you can easily transfer your save to the full game to finish your quest!<br><br>Bear in mind that you'll need a controller in order to play in local multiplayer!",
    "short_description": "INK INSIDE is a beat-em-up meets dodgeball action RPG featuring the voices of Brian David Gilbert (YouTube, Dropout) and Deneen Melody! (Evangelion, Romantic Killer). Experience the exciting and hilarious prologue with a friend when you play this NEW kind of Saturday morning cartoon together!",
